# =============================================================================
# X-Rechnung — local development secrets (.dev.vars)
#
# Copy to `.dev.vars` for local `wrangler dev`. In production use:
#   wrangler secret put DATA_ENCRYPTION_KEY
#
# Per the specification amendment, NO business configuration lives here.
# Owner email, domains, tax numbers, invoice texts, KoSIT URL/API key,
# Cloudflare API token, etc. are all configured from the admin panel and
# stored in D1 (encrypted where sensitive). Only the values below are
# deployment-level bootstrap values.
# =============================================================================

# Optional. 32-byte base64 key used to encrypt sensitive settings at rest in
# D1 (secret_store: KoSIT API key, optional stored Cloudflare API token).
# Generate:  openssl rand -base64 32
#
# If omitted, the app still boots and the full invoice workflow works, but
# encrypted-at-rest secret storage is DISABLED and System Status reports the
# secret store as NOT_CONFIGURED. Nothing else is hardcoded — the first-run
# setup token is generated at runtime and printed to the Worker log.
DATA_ENCRYPTION_KEY=

# Deployment environment marker only (not business config).
ENVIRONMENT=development
